        "title": "Monster Piercing | Titanium Belly Rings",
        "text": "<p>Discover our premium collection of Titanium Belly Rings, available in both Curved and Straight designs for a comfortable, secure fit. Each piece is crafted from high quality implant grade titanium, known for its strength, durability and hypoallergenic properties, making it a perfect choice for sensitive skin and new piercings.</p><p>Our Titanium Belly Bars combine timeless design with modern shine, offering options that range from simple polished styles to sparkling pieces set with clear and coloured cubic zirconia stones. Whether you are looking for a minimalist curved bar or a classic straight style, this collection provides the perfect balance of beauty and practicality.</p><p>Every titanium belly ring in this range is designed for long lasting comfort and effortless wear, making it ideal for both healing piercings and everyday use. Choose Titanium Belly Rings for jewellery that looks stunning and feels as good as it wears.</p>",
