            "question": "Are titanium belly rings safe for new piercings?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Titanium is one of the safest materials for new or healing piercings. It is nickel-free, non-reactive, and biocompatible, making it perfect for anyone with sensitive skin or metal allergies.</p>",
